### Banking Transactions API — Sample Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or JetBrains HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 1 & 2: Create Transactions (with validation)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Deposit to ACC-12345
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Deposit to ACC-67890
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### Transfer from ACC-12345 to ACC-67890
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 250.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### Withdrawal from ACC-67890
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

###

### EUR deposit to ACC-AAAAA
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-AAAAA",
  "amount": 750.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### VALIDATION ERROR — invalid amount (3 decimal places)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 100.555,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### VALIDATION ERROR — invalid currency
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### VALIDATION ERROR — invalid account format
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "12345",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 1: Read Transactions
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

###

### Get transaction by ID (replace with a real id after creating one)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/replace-with-real-id

###

### 404 — transaction not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 3: Filtering
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Filter by accountId
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

###

### Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

###

### Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2026-12-31

###

### Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-67890&type=deposit

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 1: Account Balance
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get balance for ACC-12345
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

###

### Get balance for ACC-67890
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-67890/balance

###

### 400 — invalid account format
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/INVALID/balance

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 4A: Transaction Summary
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Summary for ACC-12345
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

###

### Summary for ACC-67890
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-67890/summary

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 4B: Interest Calculation
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5% annual rate over 30 days for ACC-12345
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

###

### 3.5% annual rate over 365 days for ACC-AAAAA
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-AAAAA/interest?rate=0.035&days=365

###

### 400 — missing rate param
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?days=30

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 4C: CSV Export
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Export all transactions as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/export?format=csv

###

### 400 — unsupported format
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/export?format=json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASK 4D: Rate Limiting (429 after 100 req/min)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Normal request — returns 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
